{"id":3289,"slug":"3289-typeorm-query-builder-vs-repository-api-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","category":"NestJS","subcategory":"Database & ORM","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"TypeORM Query Builder vs Repository API — khi nào dùng cái nào?","question_en":"TypeORM Query Builder vs Repository API — when to use each?","answer_vi":"**Repository API** (High-level): phù hợp cho CRUD đơn giản, dễ đọc, type-safe:\n```typescript\nconst users = await this.usersRepo.find({\n  where: { isActive: true, role: Role.USER },\n  relations: ['profile'],\n  order: { createdAt: 'DESC' },\n  take: 20, skip: 0,\n});\n```\n\n**Query Builder** (Low-level): cho queries phức tạp với dynamic conditions, subqueries, raw SQL expressions:\n```typescript\nconst result = await this.usersRepo\n  .createQueryBuilder('user')\n  .leftJoinAndSelect('user.posts', 'post')\n  .where('user.isActive = :active', { active: true })\n  .andWhere('post.publishedAt > :date', { date: lastWeek })\n  .select(['user.id', 'user.email', 'COUNT(post.id) as postCount'])\n  .groupBy('user.id')\n  .having('COUNT(post.id) > 0')\n  .orderBy('postCount', 'DESC')\n  .getRawMany();\n```\n\nDùng Repository API cho 80% cases. Dùng Query Builder khi: complex JOINs, aggregations (COUNT/SUM/AVG), dynamic WHERE conditions, raw SQL expressions cần.","answer_en":"**Repository API**: best for simple CRUD, readable, type-safe:\n```typescript\nconst users = await this.usersRepo.find({ where: { isActive: true }, relations: ['profile'] });\n```\n\n**Query Builder**: for complex dynamic queries:\n```typescript\nconst result = await this.usersRepo.createQueryBuilder('user')\n  .leftJoinAndSelect('user.posts', 'post')\n  .where('user.isActive = :active', { active: true })\n  .groupBy('user.id').getRawMany();\n```\n\nUse Repository API for 80% of cases. Use Query Builder for: complex JOINs, aggregations, dynamic WHERE conditions, raw SQL expressions.","answer_html_vi":"<p><strong>Repository API</strong> (High-level): phù hợp cho CRUD đơn giản, dễ đọc, type-safe:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const users = await this.usersRepo.find({\n  where: { isActive: true, role: Role.USER },\n  relations: ['profile'],\n  order: { createdAt: 'DESC' },\n  take: 20, skip: 0,\n});\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> users = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">usersRepo</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">find</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">where</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">isActive</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Role</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">USER</span> },\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">relations</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;profile&#x27;</span>],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">order</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">createdAt</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;DESC&#x27;</span> },\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">take</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">20</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">skip</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>,\n});</code></pre></div><p><strong>Query Builder</strong> (Low-level): cho queries phức tạp với dynamic conditions, subqueries, raw SQL expressions:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const result = await this.usersRepo\n  .createQueryBuilder('user')\n  .leftJoinAndSelect('user.posts', 'post')\n  .where('user.isActive = :active', { active: true })\n  .andWhere('post.publishedAt &gt; :date', { date: lastWeek })\n  .select(['user.id', 'user.email', 'COUNT(post.id) as postCount'])\n  .groupBy('user.id')\n  .having('COUNT(post.id) &gt; 0')\n  .orderBy('postCount', 'DESC')\n  .getRawMany();\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> result = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">usersRepo</span>\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createQueryBuilder</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user&#x27;</span>)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">leftJoinAndSelect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user.posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;post&#x27;</span>)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">where</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user.isActive = :active&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">active</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span> })\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">andWhere</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;post.publishedAt &gt; :date&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">date</span>: lastWeek })\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">select</span>([<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user.id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user.email&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;COUNT(post.id) as postCount&#x27;</span>])\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">groupBy</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user.id&#x27;</span>)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">having</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;COUNT(post.id) &gt; 0&#x27;</span>)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">orderBy</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;postCount&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;DESC&#x27;</span>)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getRawMany</span>();</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng Repository API cho 80% cases.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Dùng Query Builder khi: complex JOINs, aggregations (COUNT/SUM/AVG), dynamic WHERE conditions, raw SQL expressions cần.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><strong>Repository API</strong>: best for simple CRUD, readable, type-safe:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const users = await this.usersRepo.find({ where: { isActive: true }, relations: ['profile'] });\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> users = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">usersRepo</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">find</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">where</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">isActive</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span> }, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">relations</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;profile&#x27;</span>] });</code></pre></div><p><strong>Query Builder</strong>: for complex dynamic queries:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const result = await this.usersRepo.createQueryBuilder('user')\n  .leftJoinAndSelect('user.posts', 'post')\n  .where('user.isActive = :active', { active: true })\n  .groupBy('user.id').getRawMany();\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> result = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">usersRepo</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createQueryBuilder</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user&#x27;</span>)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">leftJoinAndSelect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user.posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;post&#x27;</span>)\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">where</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user.isActive = :active&#x27;</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">active</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span> })\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">groupBy</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user.id&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getRawMany</span>();</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Use Repository API for 80% of cases.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Use Query Builder for: complex JOINs, aggregations, dynamic WHERE conditions, raw SQL expressions.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3269-cach-tich-hop-typeorm-voi-nestjs-repository-pattern-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","title":"Cách tích hợp TypeORM với NestJS? Repository pattern hoạt động như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3274-prisma-voi-nestjs-setup-va-so-sanh-voi-typeorm","title":"Prisma với NestJS — setup và so sánh với TypeORM?"},{"url":"/q/3260-nestjs-la-gi-tai-sao-nen-dung-nestjs-thay-vi-express-thuan","title":"NestJS là gì? Tại sao nên dùng NestJS thay vì Express thuần?"},{"url":"/q/3261-module-trong-nestjs-la-gi-giai-thich-cau-truc-module-decorator","title":"Module trong NestJS là gì? Giải thích cấu trúc @Module decorator."},{"url":"/q/3262-controller-trong-nestjs-lam-gi-cach-dinh-nghia-routes-voi-decorators","title":"Controller trong NestJS làm gì? Cách định nghĩa routes với decorators?"},{"url":"/q/3263-provider-va-dependency-injection-trong-nestjs-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","title":"Provider và Dependency Injection trong NestJS hoạt động như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3264-giai-thich-request-lifecycle-trong-nestjs-middleware-guards-interceptors-pipes-c","title":"Giải thích Request Lifecycle trong NestJS: Middleware → Guards → Interceptors → Pipes → Controller → Exception Filters."},{"url":"/q/3265-guards-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-implement-jwt-auth-guard","title":"Guards trong NestJS là gì? Cách implement JWT Auth Guard?"}]}